.TH RPS_PAIJO 1 "February 2025" "Version 2.0.2" "Rust, Paper, Scissors Manual"

.SH NAME
rps_paijo \- A Rock, Paper, Scissors game with customizable rules.

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B rps_paijo
[\-h | \-\-help] [\-V | \-\-version] [\-r | \-\-rounds <ROUNDS>] [\-a | \-\-auto] [
.B \-\-skip <ROUND> | \-\-skip-rounds <ROUND,ROUND,...> | \-\-skip-even | \-\-skip-odd | \-\-skip-prime | \-\-skip-all]
.B [\-\-set-start-round <ROUND>] [\-\-set-even-round | \-\-set-odd-round | \-\-set-prime-round]

.SH DESCRIPTION
Rust, Paper, Scissors is a CLI-based Rock, Paper, Scissors game written in Rust. It provides various game modes, including automatic play and custom round selection.

.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Displays the help page with all available options.

.TP
.B \-V, \-\-version
Prints the game's version.

.TP
.B \-r, \-\-rounds <ROUNDS>
Sets the round limit for the game.

.TP
.B \-a, \-\-auto
Enables automatic mode (bot vs bot).

.TP
.B \-s, \-\-skip <ROUND>
Skips the specified round.

.TP
.B \-\-skip-rounds <ROUND,ROUND,...>
Skips multiple specified rounds.

.TP
.B \-\-skip-even
Skips rounds that have even numbers.

.TP
.B \-\-skip-odd
Skips rounds that have odd numbers.

.TP
.B \-\-skip-prime
Skips rounds that are prime numbers.

.TP
.B \-\-skip-all
Skips all rounds after round 1.

.TP
.B \-\-set-start-round <ROUND>
Starts the game at a specified round.

.TP
.B \-\-set-even-round
Only plays rounds with even numbers.

.TP
.B \-\-set-odd-round
Only plays rounds with odd numbers.

.TP
.B \-\-set-prime-round
Only plays rounds with prime numbers.

.SH COMMANDS
These are special in-game commands that can be typed while playing:
.TP
.B restart, reset
Restarts the game.

.TP
.B end
Ends the game and displays the result.

.TP
.B exit
Exits the game without showing results.

.SH EXAMPLES
Play the game with 10 rounds:
.EX
rps_paijo \-\-rounds 10
.EE

Play in automatic mode:
.EX
rps_paijo \-\-auto
.EE

Start at round 5:
.EX
rps_paijo \-\-set-start-round 5
.EE

Skip rounds 3, 5, and 8:
.EX
rps_paijo \-\-skip-rounds 3,5,8
.EE

Play only even-numbered rounds:
.EX
rps_paijo \-\-set-even-round
.EE

